menu "Station: receiver supervisor"

    config STATION_AUTO_FLASH_UTC_HOUR
        int "Automatic receiver updates only from this UTC hour on"
        range 0 23
        default 22
        help
            Planned downtime late in the UTC day only spends budget that
            unknown outages earlier in the day did not need.

    config STATION_FLASH_RESTART_ALLOWANCE_S
        int "Receiver restart and reacquisition allowance for a flash (s)"
        range 30 900
        default 180
        help
            Added to the transfer time (package size at the link rate plus
            10 %) and the survey-in time to estimate the downtime of one
            receiver update. Refine from measured runs.

endmenu
